  "bodyHash": "214ae56da0e902e9",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">-涵蓋至第 9 世代的所有寶可夢，搭配 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></span></span></strong></span></h2>\n<h4>-捕捉寶可夢，利用 18 種屬性、技能與狀態效果來強化你的隊伍。<br>-與朋友對戰或交換寶可夢。<br>-使用道具在戰鬥中強化你的寶可夢（道具、MEGA 進化、太晶化……）。</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">（別忘了啟用「Complete Cobblemon Collection」/「CCC」資源包，以修復寶可夢缺少模型的問題）</span></h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1422355/description_cc5a6074-5b87-4a2b-9dbc-922e2fa43fcb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">-僅包含隨機道具與寶可夢：<span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky Block Cobblemon</a></span></span></strong></span></h2>\n<h4>-在生存模式中打破幸運方塊，獲得隨機寶可夢或道具。<br>-使用特殊幸運方塊獲取專屬獎勵。</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1422355/description_97d5c64d-f2f5-4d2f-a5e5-afd695d0f1f9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>-搭配 Complementary Shaders <span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unbound</a></span>/<span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reimagined</a></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> </span></span>將為你的對戰帶來更佳的視覺效果</strong></span></h2>\n<h4>-打造最佳光照效果，讓你在小遊戲和競技場中享有更強的沉浸感&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">（若要切換光影，請前往「選項...」-->「影像設定...」-->「光影套件...」-->選擇你想要的光影-->點擊「套用」按鈕並等待幾秒鐘）</span></h4>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1422355/description_d6b35a5e-b93f-415f-ae37-8eab0310e8bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\"></h4>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
